<h1>🚨 Suspicious Login Attempt Flagged</h1>
<p>Hello {{name}},</p>
<p>We detected a suspicious login attempt to your QuickLink account. We have flagged this event for your review:</p>

<div class="stat-box" style="border-left-color: #FF9F43;">
  <table style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse;">
    <tr style="border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(42, 42, 62, 0.4);">
      <td style="padding: 8px 0; color: #A0A0B0; font-weight: bold; width: 120px;">IP Address:</td>
      <td style="padding: 8px 0; color: #FFFFFF; font-family: monospace;">{{ipAddress}}</td>
    </tr>
    <tr style="border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(42, 42, 62, 0.4);">
      <td style="padding: 8px 0; color: #A0A0B0; font-weight: bold;">Location:</td>
      <td style="padding: 8px 0; color: #FFFFFF;">{{country}}</td>
    </tr>
    <tr style="border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(42, 42, 62, 0.4);">
      <td style="padding: 8px 0; color: #A0A0B0; font-weight: bold;">Browser:</td>
      <td style="padding: 8px 0; color: #FFFFFF;">{{browser}}</td>
    </tr>
    <tr style="border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(42, 42, 62, 0.4);">
      <td style="padding: 8px 0; color: #A0A0B0; font-weight: bold;">Risk Score:</td>
      <td style="padding: 8px 0; color: #FF5252; font-weight: bold;">{{riskScore}} / 100</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td style="padding: 8px 0; color: #A0A0B0; font-weight: bold;">Reason:</td>
      <td style="padding: 8px 0; color: #FFFFFF;">{{suspiciousReason}}</td>
    </tr>
  </table>
</div>

<p style="color: #FF5252; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 24px;">
  If you do not recognize this activity, please change your password immediately to protect your links.
</p>

<div style="text-align: center; margin-top: 30px;">
  <a href="{{appUrl}}" class="btn" style="background-color: #FF5252;">Secure Account Now 🔐</a>
</div>

<p>Best regards,<br>The QuickLink Security Team</p>
